    AND (NOT `the survivor`'s `the survivor is entitled to a choice under section 8(2) of the 2014 Act`)

-- Paragraph (2): the two things that may be chosen are the two members of `Payment chosen`.
-- Paragraphs (2), (9), (10): what a choice, or an altered choice, leads to.
-- src:225 | (2) The person may choose to be paid—
-- src:226 | (a) a lump sum under regulation 19; or
-- src:227 | (b) a state pension under regulation 20.
-- src:241 | (9) Where paragraph (1) applies to a person and that person makes a choice under—
-- src:242 | (a) section 8(2)(a) of the 2014 Act, they are to be paid a lump sum under regulation 19 (subject to paragraph (10));
-- src:243 | (b) section 8(2)(b) of the 2014 Act, they are to be paid a state pension under regulation 20 (subject to paragraph (10)).
-- src:244 | (10) Where paragraph (1) applies to a person and that person alters a choice under regulation 6—
