GIVEN `the payment chosen` IS A `Payment chosen`
GIVETH A `What is paid under regulation 18`
`what is paid when the payment chosen is` `the payment chosen` MEANS
    IF   `the payment chosen` EQUALS `a lump sum`
    THEN `a lump sum under regulation 19`
    ELSE `a state pension under regulation 20`

-- Paragraphs (5) and (11): a person who fails to make a choice within the period is paid a lump sum.
