    WHEN JUST `a choice` THEN
        IF   NOT (`it was given in a manner the Regulations allow` (`a choice`'s `how the choice was made`))
        THEN `what is paid where no choice has been made` (`the facts`'s `the period for making a choice has ended without one being made`)
        ELSE IF   `where the choice falls against its period` (`a choice`'s `the facts for the period`) EQUALS `within the period for making the choice`
             THEN `what is paid when the payment chosen is` (`a choice`'s `the payment chosen`)
