                  THEN IF   `a late choice may be made` (`a choice`'s `the facts for a late choice`)
                       THEN `what is paid when the payment chosen is` (`a choice`'s `the payment chosen`)
                       ELSE `a lump sum under regulation 19`
                  ELSE `the Regulations do not say, because the choice was made before its period began`

